WEBVTT

00:04:59.102 --> 00:05:01.729
grow sorghum in northern Nigeria?

00:05:02.882 --> 00:05:05.715
Why does Nigeria not aspire

00:05:05.739 --> 00:05:07.143
to feed the world,

00:05:07.866 --> 00:05:09.095
not just itself?

00:05:09.797 --> 00:05:13.628
If Africa's land is so poor,
as we are often told,

00:05:13.652 --> 00:05:15.860
why are outsiders,

00:05:15.884 --> 00:05:20.049
from the United Arab Emirates
all the way to South Korea,

00:05:20.073 --> 00:05:23.325
buying up vast acreages of our land,

00:05:23.349 --> 00:05:25.517
to grow food, no less,

00:05:25.541 --> 00:05:27.238
to feed their people

00:05:27.262 --> 00:05:30.884
in lands that are truly more
geographically stinting?